<title>SINGAPORE: Hotel Malaysia interim profit up 0.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Hotel Malaysia interim profit up 0.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     7.27  vs  7.24</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)		  45.00  vs 45.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		   44.00  vs 44.00</p>
<p>    Turnover				33.17  vs 26.10</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	0.84  vs  0.63</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   3.97  vs  3.14</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	     1.47  vs  1.55</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			10.37  vs  9.56</p>
<p>    Tax					3.11  vs  2.32</p>
<p>Dividend pay date: To be announced</p>
<p>Last day books open: May 27, 1997</p>
<p>Note - The company's full name is Hotel Malaysia Ltd. -- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
